{
  "voice": "voice-00",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "1948年的东京，雪夜里，帝国银行亮着一扇灯。",
      "sha256": "86dbe2f614c56dc73db77986b35752c9b6b1b7b4f688b3ed8a07586f90ac1758"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "一个自称防疫官的男人，敲响了银行后门。",
      "sha256": "d70e1fe835a3257d9cd79b29cf7c5baeec0663b49d72cb1ac6ee5219061725c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他递上名片，自称山口二郎，说附近爆发了痢疾。",
      "sha256": "ac814bf67cfea4e77307ee9603d137e4640bd5379e10a82591b0ef0b87f6ca44"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他声称奉命送来预防药，要求职员立刻服用。",
      "sha256": "045d7598356497c86b6f9e6e8172a917986fd26a9ea05edb6f09536f44cd23fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "窗外，美军吉普车驶过，没人敢多问。",
      "sha256": "bad0a90537b9be1c9125e9a06b911c2c8863caba606290fe37576e8d9ed1e484"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "药箱里，装着两种透明药水。",
      "sha256": "2f6989433bc904a5ce4e4064f5532261bc8cf111c6a2d938c39ef1dbb38eedfd"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他让十六个人排成一排，每人面前放一只小杯。",
      "sha256": "eb7809c10250bdfd5beddf899f9d555482c13f590fa684dfc2f9d44b03306f59"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "先喝第一种，他还亲自举杯示范。",
      "sha256": "474e06431ff23e5217c3925a68a4c2bddd4d0155c8ed790a878c35c1a101fb5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "一分钟，秒针一格一格地走过。",
      "sha256": "c534c38bd7806514b4c8729b10628529b92e29170c4f097f885f90e023e10d21"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "随后，第二种药水倒进杯中。",
      "sha256": "7c110fbe29cd79ccfd9d064f904218f2af7a950f1d6c25072bc7a7604e2d8087"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "几分钟后，杯子落地，算盘珠滚进柜台底下。",
      "sha256": "1ee428a8f06b0b59b61c73abc38cea3b73c73e90a76a32b62fe9ccc37a473e93"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他拿走现金和支票，趁乱离开银行。",
      "sha256": "0f64bff04a90917f1bed39ae87861723fa2581bf51a248de2416bc97381ea527"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "警车和救护车赶到，街上聚来围观者。",
      "sha256": "113e282acf74e28d9c6c2cac6babddc7a38ddf11dd2053c75cf90ba592d911e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "印刷机轰鸣，案件迅速登上报纸。",
      "sha256": "f73a1c12bfabf554f215721ca6599b479a7393578c84d7cd0fad81c3c63f7ea2"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "警方发现，他曾在两家银行用相似说辞演练。",
      "sha256": "c766b0973142f1efd4717f725a9dd5166ded0bd823d9019fb3110fe7b7533462"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "安田银行的职员拒绝了他，男人转身离开。",
      "sha256": "6254e37dbbb212f4376b9cbeeaa32bd3da893b97a65b265251d03659293db84d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 99,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "一张名片，成为追查身份的重要线索。",
      "sha256": "2d13c7d613b26ea08436fa61a391a2ca12ad73c273a62fff20ee553c02b4d89b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 105,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "名片属于松井蔚医生，他却不认识来人。",
      "sha256": "531adb339e37596412a7bc33f6e4fa839e3df71fd301833f80379e0d74f6acf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "警方顺着名片流向，把线索织成一张网。",
      "sha256": "e63f423d520e4211a210a4f6967c025b61779a492bbd8083927ba60cf5535862"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "网的尽头，是北海道小樽的一位画家。",
      "sha256": "9b3c499f2902d8da17dd5dd61c592e6b90d05dcbd1ac51205e0af0d7edb92892"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "他叫平泽贞通，五十七岁，正在画室作画。",
      "sha256": "f94150a44d6a1dcb80920d471a3f9a8b4cd360f2b9385ec8b2e44d07df21f786"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "1948年8月21日，他在北海道被捕。",
      "sha256": "8d72a749905958214f7f4c45dc63dd61229c0400bf6fe523db95a01af0a75a19"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "审讯中，他承认了罪行，供述写在纸上。",
      "sha256": "21f4f710904afa5e967d432ab45849d9faf5b693c6c988d0a386c81afd38aee4"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 142,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "但到了法庭，他立刻翻供，称口供被迫。",
      "sha256": "4ab48b3af0a17e9783964dce2248c8ea3402ac4a6e3562a80b268d04b67dcd9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 149,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "法槌落下，案子的争议却没有结束。",
      "sha256": "3231f1ad9c00026862d6335f4515ed7734ca4ca1532520ecccfeb10b4fe4ebfa"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 155,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "1950年，平泽贞通被判处死刑。",
      "sha256": "22835d805367d6e8004be73037ec05893b250ea52ce68cfb1cb2fbda637f658d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 161,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "四十多名目击者，最终只有两人认出他。",
      "sha256": "d5943410a95d0b9d488a07b4f5d3c31f6707ed0ce4a632e41830135efdd7b339"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 167,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "关于731部队涉案的说法，至今只是传闻。",
      "sha256": "072ea60b501d7da74b099c5c0f305da803b4ca72683144459a921f4552f01285"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 172,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "text": "死刑从未执行。他喊冤近四十年，1987年病逝狱中。真凶是谁？",
      "sha256": "d2d46bbc16ba7eba69c233b786134b256dd73c5f68f7db17119fa5b80a0bac60"
    }
  ]
}
